mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微信视觉团队开源多模态嵌入模型WeMM-Embedding，日调用量超十亿</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI正式发布最新大模型GPT-6Astra，黄仁勋称AGI时代已到来</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic Claude模型在黎曼猜想证明中取得重大突破</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">科大讯飞发布星火 X2.5 大模型：采用 293B MoE 架构并开源端侧模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0285c759946719d803ad78096fb459b5.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">科大讯飞正式发布星火 X2.5 大模型，该模型采用 MoE 架构，参数规模达 293B-A30B，重点强化代码编写、智能体交互及数学理解等通用能力。星火 X2.5 基于全国产算力完成全流程训练与推理，并针对国产超长序列训推难题进行了专项优化，目前已正式上线讯飞开放平台。在端侧布局方面，科大讯飞此前已开源星火 X2.5-4B 和 1.7B 两款模型，均支持最高 100 万 Token 上下文处理能力，可本地部署于长文档分析、代码辅助及数据处理等场景。此次旗舰模型的发布，标志着科大讯飞在云端与端侧产品线均已完成新版本迭代，进一步完善了其国产化大模型生态布局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软发布MAI-Image-2.6-Flash模型：生成速度提升2.8倍且成本减半</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ddce85bf7aa0cb7a4ddbcf43207efbd.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软于2026年9月正式推出MAI-Image-2.6-Flash，这是MAI-Image-2.6的高效率轻量化变体，现已通过Microsoft Foundry开启公开预览。测试显示，该模型图像生成速度达到GPT-Image-2-Medium的2.8倍，综合效率提升72%。在保持核心生成与编辑能力的同时，Flash版本将文本、图像输入及图像输出的每百万Token价格分别降至1.75美元、2.50美元和19美元，较主模型降本超50%。该模型支持最多5张参考图以保障角色一致性，集成Bing搜索补充现实信息，并支持动态宽高比与高分辨率输出。微软建议将Flash版本应用于交互式应用、快速创意迭代及大规模自动化流程，而主模型则聚焦于对画质要求苛刻的商业设计场景。此次发布标志着微软在AI图像生成领域向高并发、低延迟及成本敏</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微信视觉团队开源多模态嵌入模型WeMM-Embedding，日调用量超十亿</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/39fbc6eff59f81ffef240279c028bc7e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯微信视觉团队正式开源通用多模态嵌入模型WeMM-Embedding，该模型全面支持文本与图像等多模态输入。在版本布局上，WeMM-Embedding提供2B、4B及9B三种体量，以适配多样化的部署需求。技术架构方面，该模型采用统一设计，结合两阶段训练及知识蒸馏技术，在提升多模态理解能力的同时，有效兼顾了实际落地中的部署效率。目前，该模型已在微信推荐与搜索系统中实现大规模部署，线上日调用量突破十亿量级。此次开源旨在为AI开发者提供技术支撑，推动人工智能在更多垂直领域的创新应用，标志着微信在多模态AI技术生态建设上的进一步开放，为行业AI应用开发提供强有力的技术赋能。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI正式发布最新大模型GPT-6Astra，黄仁勋称AGI时代已到来</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bc5db650b5a3f0f9c43f7a2e50eb5934.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于9月3日正式发布最新大模型GPT-6Astra，官方定位其为全球最智能且符合人类价值观的模型，具备极高的处理速度、准确性及复杂专业任务执行力。英伟达CEO黄仁勋对此公开祝贺并明确表示“AGI已经到来”，OpenAI总裁格雷格·布罗克曼亦宣称行业正式迈入通用人工智能时代。从ChatGPT、o1到Astra，OpenAI在四年内完成了技术路线的重大跨越。然而，该发布引发了学术界与产业界的激烈争议。AI学者加里·马库斯指出，Astra仅满足其提出的AGI定义标准中的一至两项，缺乏科学定论。OpenAI CEO萨姆·奥尔特曼则持克制态度，认为AGI目前仍是定义模糊的术语。此次发布不仅刷新了AI能力边界，更促使行业重新审视通用人工智能在科学标准与商业定义之间的鸿沟。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic Claude模型在黎曼猜想证明中取得重大突破</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ed27cb97fa09f4c312adc3b540708d52.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic旗下Claude模型在黎曼猜想证明中取得关键进展，成功确认超过67.25%的zeta零点位于临界线上且为单零点，打破了该领域长达37年的停滞。Claude通过计算巨大矩阵的迹、Hilbert–Schmidt范数及秩-迹不等式实现突破，随后数论学家Youness Lamzouri通过希尔伯特空间不等式对证明进行了简化与归约。该成果在发布后数小时内，即由AxiomProver工具在Lean语言中完成了机器级形式化验证。此事件标志着数学研究进入“AI探索+人类洞察+机器验证”的新范式，不仅大幅推进了黎曼猜想的证明进程，还推动了孪生素数猜想等相关领域的研究。这一协作模式彻底终结了传统数学依赖漫长人工评审的时代，展示了AI在处理高阶数学难题中的计算潜力与验证效率。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
